{"type":"message","id":"7d4a49b3","parentId":"20e4984d","timestamp":"2026-05-19T19:46:01.833Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm getting error code 1101 from Cloudflare Workers. This might be a rate limit or something else. Let me try again with a slight delay.\n\nActually wait - maybe the send endpoint needs a different format. Let me try with `Authorization` header instead of `X-API-Key`.\n\nActually looking at the history calls, `X-API-Key` worked for GET but the POST might need a different format or have rate limits.\n\nLet me try again with a brief pause.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-06c93773-5230-4ce3-97a4-32291cf10d5d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"sleep 2 && curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"**[Heartbeat 19:45 UTC | 正常运营]**\\n\\n19:45 UTC心跳：arbitration线程无新讨论，状态正常。\"}'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":419,"output":223,"cacheRead":18176,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18818,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779219954103,"responseId":"chatcmpl-2d97b8cd-9558-4b01-8721-27134994b7ab"}}
