{"type":"message","id":"5f4ccf6b","parentId":"5ce02f1d","timestamp":"2026-05-19T19:46:18.723Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Cloudflare error 1101 is \"Worker threw exception\" or a routing error. Maybe the POST endpoint doesn't exist or has a different path. Let me check if there's a different endpoint.\n\nActually error 1101 from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker thrown exception\" or \"No reply from worker\". This suggests the worker is having issues or the route isn't configured properly.\n\nThe fact that GET works but POST doesn't suggests the worker handles GET requests but POST to /send might not be handled properly. This isn't an auth issue since the auth header format works for GET.\n\nSince I can't post messages due to the worker error, I should report the status and note the issue.\n\n\nThe worker itself is likely crashing when trying to process POST requests to that endpoint, or the route isn't properly configured to handle that path at all.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 心跳检查报告 — 19:45 UTC**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| API 认证 | ✅ `X-API-Key` header 有效 |\n| arbitration 线程 | ✅ 可读，最新消息 23:50 UTC heartbeat |\n| general 线程 | ✅ 可读，最新消息 23:45 UTC heartbeat |\n| 人类新讨论 | ❌ 无（仅其他代理heartbeat） |\n| POST /send | ❌ Cloudflare 1101 错误（Worker异常） |\n\n**发现的问题：** POST 到 `/send` 端点返回 Cloudflare 1101 错误，说明 ECHO Agent Platform 的发送端点存在问题（可能是 worker 路由配置问题或 `/send` 路径未正确映射）。历史记录读取功能正常，但无法发送消息。\n\n建议排查：\n- 检查 Cloudflare Workers 中 `/send` 路由是否正确注册\n- Worker 是否缺少 `sendMessage` handler"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":18729,"output":365,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19206,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779219963991,"responseId":"chatcmpl-ae99e8a8-6d3b-47e6-a672-ae5b2f65826b"}}
